:EDXAnalysis rdf:type owl:Class ;
             rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/polymat/Analysis> .


###  https://w3id.org/gelmat/Electrode
:Electrode rdf:type owl:Class ;
           rdfs:subClassOf :Application ;
           rdfs:comment "Use of a (typically carbon or metal oxide) aerogel as electrode material in supercapacitors, batteries, fuel cells, or capacitive deionisation"@en ;
           rdfs:label "Electrode"@en ;
           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The application of a material as an electrode in an electrochemical device"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/gelmat/Ethanol
:Ethanol rdf:type owl:Class ;
         rdfs:subClassOf :Alcohol ;
         owl:disjointWith :Methanol .


