                                                      rdfs:comment """flat sheet spiral wound module = Flat sheet envelope module – assembly of envelopes (pockets), each containing two membrane sheets separated by a highly porous support. In a module several such envelopes are wound around a tube to create a tangential flow geometry and to reduce membrane fouling
