      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "SAXS"@en ;
      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An analysis that measures elastic X-ray scattering at small angles to characterise nanostructure (fractal scaling, particle and cluster sizes) of a material"@en .


:SodiumCarbonate rdfs:comment "Sodium carbonate (Na2CO3), a mild base used as the classic catalyst of resorcinol-formaldehyde aerogel synthesis (the R/C ratio refers to it)"@en ;
