                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Caustic soda"@en ;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The strong base NaOH, used as a base catalyst and pH adjuster in sol-gel processing"@en ;
