:SodiumSilicate rdfs:comment "Aqueous sodium silicate (water glass, Na2O·nSiO2), the industrial low-cost silica precursor; requires ion exchange (gmat:IonExchange) or acid neutralisation to remove sodium ions before gelation"@en ;
