            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An analysis that images the nanostructure of a thin specimen by transmission of an electron beam"@en .


:TMOS rdfs:comment "Tetramethoxysilane (TMOS, Si(OCH3)4), a fast-hydrolysing silica precursor; yields finer networks than TEOS but releases toxic methanol"@en ;
      rdfs:label "Tetramethoxysilane"@en ;
      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "TMOS"@en ,
