      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The silicon alkoxide Si(OCH3)4, a rapidly hydrolysing silica precursor for sol-gel processing"@en .


:Tannin rdfs:comment "Condensed or hydrolysable plant tannins, bio-based polyphenols used with formaldehyde or furfural as low-cost precursors of tannin-based organic and carbon aerogels"@en ;
        rdfs:label "Tannin"@en ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A plant-derived polyphenol used as a bio-based phenolic precursor in organic aerogel syntheses"@en ;
