                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The silicon alkoxide Si(OC2H5)4 (TEOS), a widely used silica precursor that undergoes hydrolysis and condensation in sol-gel processing"@en .


:ThermogravimetricAnalysis rdfs:comment "Measurement of sample mass as a function of temperature, used for thermal stability, organic content, and decomposition behaviour of aerogels; performed on a pmat:ThermogravimetricAnalyzer"@en ;
