:TitaniumIsopropoxide rdfs:comment "Titanium(IV) isopropoxide (TTIP, Ti(OiPr)4), the standard alkoxide precursor for titania aerogels; hydrolyses very rapidly and usually requires chelating agents or acid moderation"@en ;
