                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The titanium alkoxide Ti(OC3H7)4, used as a precursor for titania gels"@en .


:Trimethylchlorosilane rdfs:comment "PubChem CID 11636 (trimethylchlorosilane, CAS 75-77-4)"@en ,
                                    "Trimethylchlorosilane (TMCS, CAS 75-77-4): a reactive chlorosilane that reacts with surface silanol groups to introduce hydrophobic trimethylsilyl groups, enabling ambient pressure drying"@en ;
                       rdfs:label "Trimethylchlorosilane"@en ;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Chlorotrimethylsilane"@en ,
