             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An analysis that measures the kinetic energy of X-ray-excited photoelectrons to determine surface composition and chemical states"@en .


:XRayDiffraction rdfs:comment "Wide-angle X-ray diffraction, used to establish the amorphous or crystalline state of aerogels and the phase of metal oxide aerogels (e.g. anatase vs rutile titania)"@en ;
