                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An analysis that measures Bragg diffraction of X-rays to identify crystalline phases and crystallite sizes"@en .


:ZirconiumPropoxide rdfs:comment "Zirconium(IV) n-propoxide (Zr(OnPr)4, typically supplied in n-propanol), the standard alkoxide precursor for zirconia aerogels"@en ;
